th-pk-shootout</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/9/womens-soccer-wvus-2026-big-12-tournament-ends-with-pk-shootout</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Alexis Pashales dribbles down the field during the quarterfinals of the 2026 Big 12 Tournament." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/9/Big_12_Tournament-4.jpg" /><br /><br />MANSFIELD, Texas – Despite a 90th minute goal to send the match into overtime, the No. 8-seeded West Virginia University women's soccer team played to a 1-1 draw with No. 1-seed BYU in double overtime. Following a penalty kick shootout to decide the advancing team, the Cougars won 4-2 to advance to the semifinals of the 2026 Big 12 Tournament inside Texas Health Mansfield Stadium in Mansfield, Texas, on Monday afternoon.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/Big_12_Tournament-4.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/Big_12_Tournament-4.jpg"><media:title>Alexis Pashales dribbles down the field during the quarterfinals of the 2026 Big 12 Tournament.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/Big_12_Tournament-4.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:27:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59671</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>